  "thag6.6:1.1": "Paṇṇavīsativassāni ",
  "thag6.6:1.2": "yato pabbajito ahaṃ ",
  "thag6.6:1.3": "accharāsaṃghātamattam pi ",
  "thag6.6:1.4": "cetosantim anajjhagaṃ. ",
  "thag6.6:2.1": "aladdhā cittass' ekaggaṃ ",
  "thag6.6:2.2": "kāmarāgena addito ",
  "thag6.6:2.3": "bāhā paggayha kandanto ",
  "thag6.6:2.4": "vihārān upanikkhamiṃ. ",
  "thag6.6:3.1": "satthaṃ vā āharissāmi, ",
  "thag6.6:3.2": "ko attho jīvitena me, ",
  "thag6.6:3.3": "kathaṃ hi sikkhaṃ paccakkhaṃ ",
  "thag6.6:3.4": "kālaṃ kubbetha mādiso. ",
  "thag6.6:4.1": "tadāhaṃ khuram ādāya ",
  "thag6.6:4.2": "mañcakamhi upāvisiṃ; ",
  "thag6.6:4.3": "parinīto khuro āsi ",
  "thag6.6:4.4": "dhamaniṃ chettum attano. ",
  "thag6.6:5.1": "tato me . . . (409,410 = 269,270) Uṭṭhāhi ",
